  "goodToKnow": "Der Sattel is a saddle, on a horse or a bike: den Sattel verstellen (to adjust the saddle). Figuratively, fest im Sattel sitzen means to be secure in a position, and jemanden aus dem Sattel heben means to oust someone. Sattelfest means well-versed: in Grammatik sattelfest sein. In geography, a Sattel is a saddle between two mountain peaks. The plural has an umlaut: die Sättel."
